Z||000000||fieroX||12-08-2001||03:04 AM||||So this morning my dad and I went deer hunting up to the north east about an hour from Wichita.  On the way back we drive through a town called El Dorado, its a pretty small town in comparison to Wichita, but still has quite a bit of traffic.  So we are heading to sonic to pick up a cheeseburger and I look over to a side street off the main road, and I see an old style MR2 made into a police car.  It had a real small light bar on top and all the badging and everything.  I started laughing my ass off.  It looked hilarous.  I wished I had my digital camera so bad.  I think one of these days when I have a day off and am bored Im going to drive back up there and try to find it and take a picture.  Just thought id share.<P>------------------<BR>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif">  </A><BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroX.com</A><BR>coming soon L67 powered 87 coupe||||reg||1
